flowchart TD
  A["A call to Harbourline fails"] --> B{"What came back?"}
  B -- "no answer, timeout" --> W
  B -- "5xx (Harbourline broken)" --> W
  B -- "401 or 403<br/>(login or permission)" --> W
  B -- "429 (too many requests)" --> P["Pause for Retry-After seconds"]
  P --> W
  B -- "other 4xx<br/>(bad data, not enough stock)" --> R["Park the order as failed,<br/>with Harbourline's reason"]
  W["Keep the order waiting.<br/>Health turns red. Retry next cycle."]
  W --> X["Retried with the same<br/>idempotency key, so never doubled"]
  R --> Y["Health stays green:<br/>the connector did its job"]
